35. In this petition, the petitioner has prayed for the following reliefs:
a. quashing the first set of notifications, preliminary and final, issued under Sections 3A and 3G of the NH Act on 03.11.2000 and 11.09.2001 (respectively);
b. quashing the second set of notifications dated 17.08.2012 issued under Section 3A and declaration dated 09.07.2013 issued under Section 3G of the NH Act;
c. quashing the sale deed dated 21.11.2006 executed in favour of the NHAI in respect of 2,178 sq. ft.
of land; and d. mandamus to direct the NHAI to pay damages caused to him and to acquire 9 guntas of land under Sections 14 and 15 of the NHAI Act by - 16 - NC: 2024:KHC:17146 disposing of his application dated 15.05.2023 within a specific time frame.
36.
